### KnowledgeForge Context Review API (Tasks 4.1-4.4)
### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@systemId = wps
@snapshotId = wps-snap-001

### 1) Fetch Level-1 context (generated + override + effective + provenance)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/context/{{systemId}}/level1?snapshot_id={{snapshotId}}&min_confidence=0.80
X-Role: viewer
Accept: application/json

### 2) Create/update field override (editor)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/context/{{systemId}}/overrides
X-Role: editor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "field_path": "owner",
  "value": "payments-sme",
  "updated_by": "api-test-editor",
  "override_reason": "SME correction"
}

### 3) Transition review status to reviewed (approver)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/context/{{systemId}}/review-status
X-Role: approver
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "reviewed",
  "updated_by": "api-test-approver"
}

### 4) Transition review status to approved_for_publish (approver)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/context/{{systemId}}/review-status
X-Role: approver
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved_for_publish",
  "updated_by": "api-test-approver"
}
